 "data": {
  "title": "Books about the Slavs – what is worth reading",
  "slug": "books-about-the-slavs",
  "excerpt": "Readers often ask which books about the Slavs are of real quality and genuine informative value. On the Slovak book market that is a hard thing to find, so here is a list of popular titles that are worth reading – chosen deliberately from popular rather than specialist literature.",
  "metaTitle": "Books about the Slavs – what is worth reading",
  "metaDescription": "Which books about the Slavs have real informative value, and how to tell good writing from pseudo-historical accounts of the “true history of the Slavs”.",
  "keyFacts": [],
  "timeline": [],
  "quotes": [],
  "mediaTexts": [
   {
    "mediaId": 5089,
    "alt": "The cover of Ján Steinhübel's book Nitrianske kniežatstvo, with a battle scene from a manuscript"
   }
  ],
  "blocks": [
   {
    "__component": "content.rich-text",
    "body": [
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Readers often ask me whether I could recommend them books about the Slavs that are of good quality and have real informative value. It has to be admitted that on the Slovak book market it is genuinely difficult to find good books about the Slavs. On the other hand, we come across a fair amount of rubbish that presents itself as the “true history of the Slavs”, but whose content has little to do with history or archaeology. "
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "__component": "content.rich-text",
    "body": [
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "We have therefore tried to give readers at least a few basic tips on books about the Slavs that are worth reading. Unfortunately, many of them are no longer on sale, but they can be obtained second-hand or in libraries. We have of course chosen only popular books, not specialist publications. A list of specialist publications on archaeology can be found, for example, "
       },
       {
        "type": "link",
        "url": "http://archeol.sav.sk/index.php/sk/publikacie/edicie-vydavane-ausav/",
        "children": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "here"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "."
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
